e  the dup to do likewise  so i suppose all eyes now shift to  parliament buildings of stormont  tomorrow morning to  find out if the dup are prepared to at  least put in place uh shadow assembly  while discussions continue around high  result how to resolve this very very  thorny issue of the northern ireland  protocol david thank you david levinson  with the latest
 

